sequenceDiagram
    title Login
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web app
    participant DB@{ "type" : "database" }
    User->>+Web: POST /login
    alt valid password
        Web->>DB: load user
        activate DB
        DB-->>Web: row
        deactivate DB
    else otherwise
        Web->>Web: log failure
    end
    Web-->>-User: 200 OK
    Note over User,Web: session cookie set
